Z||000000||frontal lobe||07-19-2000||01:15 AM||||Life is funny how you wind up doing in life things you would NEVER have thought you would do.  One of those things is coming up for me this weekend.  So guess what I am going to be doing this Saturday.  Just guess.  No, really, guess.  Wrong, wrong, all wrong.  I AM SINGING IN SOMEBODY'S WEDDING!!!!!  Can you believe it?????  I can't, and I'm doing it!  Man, I would have NEVER have dreamed I would be doing this even once in my entire life, but the couple asked, so...<P>How about anyone else?  Ever wind up doing something in your life you never imagined you would do?  <P>P.S. to Cliff.  Don't get any ideas! (joke)||||reg||1
