Z||000009||frontal lobe||07-20-2000||04:50 PM||||I hope I didn't mislead you guys.  I'm singing in the WEDDING ceremony only.  I'm not singing in the reception.<P>The song the couple requested me to sing is a hymn called, "Savior, Like a Shepherd Lead Us".  If any of you know of it, it's a very pretty song with a good message.  It's more contemplative than upbeat, but I promise I WILL NOT let it drag.<P>Regarding the 20 million, they are going to have to pass the offering plate around a LOT of times to come up with that!  (joke, no offerings at a wedding)||||reg||1
